{"version":1,"key":"card:101","content":{"id":101,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"ls","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 只能查看一个层级的内容，所以当前目录下的 math 目录下的文件是查看不了的，如果希望进一步查看所包含目录的里面的内容，那么可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"-R","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 选项做到这件事情","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"93dcff75-1f0e-4a73-984d-d62b6af57dbe","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"# 递归显示目录\n~ » ls -R\n.:\nhello  hello.c  math\n\n\n./math:\nadd  add.c","collabId":"a1188813-b87b-403c-957c-6017371b42f4","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"cd00ed04-b07f-4a0f-945a-815dab204c37","language":"bash","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"f9ed7a99-b647-4041-86a6-6281eda28c67"}],"tags":["Linux/命令/ls"],"createTime":1689176665259,"updateTime":1793532517032,"linkedCards":[{"id":99,"target":{"key":"card:99","type":"card","id":99},"summary":"ls 命令的作用是查看指定目录下包含的所有文件及目录。 # 查看当前目录包含的文件及目录 ~ » ls hello hello.c math 当前目录包含两个文件 hello hello.c 和一个目录 math 。 上述 ls 命令没有指...","tags":["Linux/命令/ls"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532517032}}